{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a strange room. In front of you stands a large mirror, reflecting you and everything around you. But something is wrong: objects are misplaced, details don\u2019t match, and the light behaves differently than it should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you must restore <strong>perfect symmetry</strong> between reality and its reflection, moving step by step through a sequence of rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a short, atmospheric puzzle experience</strong>, designed to be completed in about <strong>25 minutes</strong>. There\u2019s nothing unnecessary - only tension, observation, and a growing sense of unease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you reach the final room and break the cycle of endless reflections?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the way out.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Anna\u2019s Final Image","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2527330/81f141041abf9ff5f3c3931dedc7c40cabcced09.jpg"},{"name":"Reflection of the Future","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2527330/a78234584db23403aa7ddda5214667aa08589a49.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2527330?t=1768713482","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2527330?t=1768713482","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527330/7c89e6ca94853bf486a206005e746f8ca07378cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768713482","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527330/7c89e6ca94853bf486a206005e746f8ca07378cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768713482","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a strange room. In front of you stands a large mirror, reflecting you and everything around you. But something is wrong: objects are misplaced, details don\u2019t match, and the light behaves differently than it should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you must restore <strong>perfect symmetry</strong> between reality and its reflection, moving step by step through a sequence of rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a short, atmospheric puzzle experience</strong>, designed to be completed in about <strong>25 minutes</strong>. There\u2019s nothing unnecessary - only tension, observation, and a growing sense of unease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you reach the final room and break the cycle of endless reflections?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the way out.</p>","developers":["TAMAGOSHA"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527330/e4ffb7fcfc729f19db1a801355f4a49ae4e53c5f/header.jpg?t=1768713482","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2527330/981117550/15994dfe64e0a3e3faa8e56b26db071df51e12c1/1755696024/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755826635","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2527330/981117550/15994dfe64e0a3e3faa8e56b26db071df51e12c1/1755696024/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755826635","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2527330/981117550/15994dfe64e0a3e3faa8e56b26db071df51e12c1/1755696024/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755826635","id":257186043,"name":"MERROR Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257186043/0b583f3af52cf9d70b068a2d45e431233f71589a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755826635"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2527330/449275856/ff0bb3e577b22b9bc4a5